cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Superfluid: a constant-size exact memory tier for LLMs, on a cellular-sheaf diffusion"
abstract: >-
  A pure-NumPy implementation of a sheaf-diffusion sequence architecture
  together with a frozen register: an append-only, 20-bytes-per-fact store
  that returns bit-exact token ids. Includes a 50-check self-verification
  suite and documented negative results.
type: software
version: "1.2.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - large language models
  - memory
  - cellular sheaves
  - persistent homology
  - KV cache
authors:
